IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BEVT.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT EVT-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-EVT-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
        ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-EVT-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD EVT-FILE.
01 EVT-LINE PIC X(400).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-EVT-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-EVT-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-NOW PIC X(14).
01 WS-CFG.
   05 WS-HOME-CFG PIC X(80).
   05 WS-BIZDATE PIC 9(08).
   05 WS-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
   05 WS-JRN-GEN PIC 9(09).
   05 WS-CFG-ST PIC X(02).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "BKEVTP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-EVT-PARMS.
    MOVE "00" TO BK-EVT-STATUS
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-EVT-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/journal/events.log"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-EVT-PATH
    CALL "BCFG" USING WS-CFG
    IF WS-CFG-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-CFG-ST TO BK-EVT-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE SPACES TO EVT-LINE
    STRING "EVT|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(BK-EVT-TYPE) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(BK-EVT-KEY) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        WS-BIZDATE DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        WS-NOW(1:14) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(BK-EVT-PAYLOAD) DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO EVT-LINE
    END-STRING
    OPEN EXTEND EVT-FILE
    IF WS-EVT-ST = "35"
        OPEN OUTPUT EVT-FILE
    END-IF
    IF WS-EVT-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-EVT-ST TO BK-EVT-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    WRITE EVT-LINE
    CLOSE EVT-FILE
    MOVE "00" TO BK-EVT-STATUS.
